cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "WhaleYing Memory: Structured Long-Term Memory with Conflict Resolution and Multi-Hop Retrieval for AI Agents"
authors:
  - family-names: Huang
    given-names: Jianying
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0006-3315-7073
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-21
repository-code: "https://github.com/jing-ying-dev/whale-ying-memory"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: "WhaleYing Memory is a long-term memory system for AI agents. It extracts facts, events, metrics, and identities from conversations and long documents, resolves superseded values through supersession chains and folding, retrieves current evidence with hybrid search, and supplies that evidence to an LLM for answering."
keywords:
  - AI agent
  - long-term memory
  - conflict resolution
  - multi-hop retrieval
  - hybrid search
  - information retrieval
